      "message": "I don\u0027t think that this will solve your pest problem even if pointed at the right directory.\n\nhttps://github.com/pest-parser/pest/blob/99cbc31419551af9cd377476382e85c43837daee/generator/src/lib.rs#L43\n\nNote how this is in the proc-macro? That means it is going to try to read this environment variable in the crate that is *using* it, then assume it has a `src/` directory underneath. This isn\u0027t going to work because:\n* 1p crates intentionally don\u0027t get CARGO flags set while building them\n* 1p crates may or may not have `src/` directories at all.",
